{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Toggles the freeze state of every selected track.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Unfrozen track: freeze to stereo.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Frozen track: unfreeze one freeze layer.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Mixed multi-track selections are processed independently.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab The original track selection is restored afterwards.\sa180\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Toggles the freeze state of every selected track.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Unfrozen track: measure a safe post-FX tail, then freeze to stereo.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Frozen track: unfreezes one freeze layer.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Mixed multi-track selections are processed independently.\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Requires the free SWS/S&M extension.\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Toggles the FX window of the selected track.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Closed window: close all track FX windows, then open its FX chain.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Open window: close all track FX windows.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Supports normal tracks, the master track, and floating FX.\sa180\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 icanscriptsounds\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 A personal collection of scripts for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reaper.fm/"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
REAPER
}}}
, distributed through {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://reapack.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
ReaPack
}}}
.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Install with ReaPack\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360 1.\tx360\tab In REAPER, open {\f1 Extensions > ReaPack > Import repositories...}.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360 2.\tx360\tab Paste this URL:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li360 \fi0 \f1 https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lsooxlla8/icanscriptsounds/main/index.xml\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360 3.\tx360\tab Synchronize packages.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360 4.\tx360\tab Open {\f1 Extensions > ReaPack > Browse packages...}.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360 5.\tx360\tab Find and install the desired script.\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Installed scripts are registered in REAPER's Action List.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Packages\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Freeze Toggle\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Toggles every selected track independently:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab unfrozen track \u8594 ? freeze to stereo;\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab frozen track \u8594 ? unfreeze one freeze layer.\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The script preserves the original track selection and safely handles mixed selections containing both frozen and unfrozen tracks.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Smart Freeze Toggle\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Toggles every selected track independently:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab unfrozen track \u8594 ? measure a safe post-FX tail, then freeze to stereo;\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab frozen track \u8594 ? unfreeze one freeze layer.\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The script safely handles mixed selections and requires the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.sws-extension.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
SWS/S&M extension
}}}
.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Smart Toggle FX Window\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Toggles the FX window of the selected track:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab closed window \u8594 ? close all track FX windows, then open its FX chain;\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab open window \u8594 ? close all track FX windows.\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The script supports normal tracks, the master track, FX chains, floating FX, and empty FX chains.\par}
}
